        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 07, Bronze Half Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion Hardware's Half-Round Knob is designed to fit comfortably in the hand while still looking great. Made out of bronze, it is available in dark bronze, medium bronze, and antique bronze finishes--all of which emphasize the rustic beauty of the sandcast bronze material from which this door knob has been carefully crafted. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten Bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Half Round Knob Fusion 07:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>True Bronze Product (Sandcast and Lost Wax) with over 90% Copper Content</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Rustic Door Knob Fusion 07:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>One Year Finish Warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
