                "description": "Sandcast Bronze Half-Round Door Knob Fusion 07 - Fusion Hardware's Half-Round Knob is designed to fit comfortably in the hand while still looking great. Made out of bronze, it is available in dark bronze, medium bronze, and antique bronze finishes--all of which emphasize the rustic beauty of the sandcast bronze material from which this door knob has been carefully crafted. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
